              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor="#757575" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="9">Info:	</run>
                <run bold="true" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="9">&lt;[sqlproxy.0eneto615tqdth1c3x5um1evrgid].[none:Calculation_3231242726244354:nk]&gt;</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <customized-label>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="9">Business Measure Definitions:</run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri">Æ
</run>
                <run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="9">M0(Oral Evaluation): </run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="9">.Patient received a qualifying oral evaluation during the reporting period.</run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri">Æ
</run>
                <run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="9">M1(Dental &amp; Medical History)</run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="9">: Patient had their dental and medical history completed within 12 months of the oral evaluation.</run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri">Æ
</run>
                <run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="9">M2 (Periodontal Screening): </run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="9">Patient received a periodontal screening within 12 months of the oral evaluation.</run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri">Æ
</run>
                <run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="9">M3(Oral Health Education):</run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="9"> Patient received documented oral health education within 12 months of the oral evaluation.</run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri">Æ
</run>
                <run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="9">M4(Tobacco Cessation): </run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="9">Patient identified as a smoker received tobacco cessation screening/intervention within 12 months. Non-smokers are N/A.</run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri">Æ
</run>
                <run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="9">M5(Dental Plan Created):</run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="9"> Patient had a documentated dental treatmnet plan created withing 12 of the oral evluation.</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-label>
            <style>
              <style-rule element="mark">
                <format attr="mark-labels-show" value="true"/>
                <format attr="mark-labels-cull" value="true"/>
              </style-rule>
