              <formatted-text>
                <run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#003066" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="12">The Bottom Line — </run>
                <run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#003066" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="12">&lt;[sqlproxy.1f40ugu0doqgvw16nfs9309k66sa].[usr:Calculation_ops_noe_cnt:qk]&gt;</run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#263238" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="12"> patients had a recent dental visit with no open episode. That is the gap the quality scorecard does not show. Open Episode Gap List, download the MRNs, and start an episode. Close or assign open dental encounters, starting with the oldest aging bucket. Kept visits and unique patients are how busy the panel is, not how complete care is.</run>
              </formatted-text>
