</run>
                <run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#263238" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="10">&lt;[sqlproxy.1f40ugu0doqgvw16nfs9309k66sa].[usr:Calculation_ops_noe_cnt:qk]&gt;</run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#263238" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="10"> patients had a recent dental visit with no open episode. Export Episode Gap List and start an episode.</run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri">Æ

</run>
                <run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#003066" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="11">2. Close open charts</run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri">Æ
</run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#263238" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="10">Same definition as open encounters, dental only. Start with charts open 90 days or longer.</run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri">Æ

</run>
                <run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#003066" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="11">3. Read volume last</run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontname="Calibri">Æ
</run>
                <run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#263238" fontname="Calibri" fontsize="10">Kept visits and unique patients show how busy the panel is, not how complete care is.</run>
